OL,3,GNEWSACouncil warns it could face #3.9m
OL,4,Abudget shortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth West Leicestershire District
OL,7,FCouncil has said it could face a #3.9m
OL,8,Fbudget shortfall in three years if it
OL,9,Ffails to take action now.
OL,11,FThe authority said the emerging gap
OL,12,Fbetween income and spending had been
OL,13,Fdetailed in a report given to cabinet
OL,14,Fmembers on Tuesday.
OL,16,FA combination of rising costs and
OL,17,Funcertainty over future government
OL,18,Ffunding were cited as the reason for
OL,19,Fthe forecast budget gap.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
