OL,3,GNEWSACouncil warns it could face #3.9m
OL,4,Abudget shortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said by identifying the
OL,7,Fproblem now and reviewing spending
OL,8,Fplans, it hoped to minimise the
OL,9,Fpotential impact on frontline services.
